| De | Para | Evento |
|----|------|--------|
| `NOT_STARTED` | `IN_PROGRESS` | Package Started |
| `NOT_STARTED` | `BLOCKED` | Package Blocked |
| `IN_PROGRESS` | `IN_REVIEW` | Review Requested |
| `IN_PROGRESS` | `BLOCKED` | Package Blocked |
| `IN_REVIEW` | `IN_AUDIT` | Review Approved |
| `IN_REVIEW` | `CHANGES_REQUESTED` | Review Rejected |
| `IN_REVIEW` | `BLOCKED` | Package Blocked |
| `CHANGES_REQUESTED` | `IN_PROGRESS` | Changes Started |
| `CHANGES_REQUESTED` | `BLOCKED` | Package Blocked |
| `IN_AUDIT` | `APPROVED` | Audit Approved |
| `IN_AUDIT` | `CHANGES_REQUESTED` | Audit Failed (corrigível) |
| `IN_AUDIT` | `BLOCKED` | Audit Failed (crítico) |
| `BLOCKED` | `IN_PROGRESS` | Block Resolved |
| `IN_PROGRESS` | `IN_PROGRESS` | Retomada após pausa interna (sem mudança de estado visível) |

